Error Scenarios Handled:
------------------------

1. Invalid Media Length
   - DVD with length <= 0
   - CD with total length <= 0
   - Track with length <= 0

2. UI Error Handling
   - FXML loading failures
   - Invalid user input
   - Media selection errors

3. System Errors
   - Memory issues
   - File I/O problems
   - Network connectivity (future)

Exception Safety Guarantees:
---------------------------

✅ No resource leaks
✅ Consistent object state
✅ Proper error propagation
✅ User-friendly error messages
✅ Graceful degradation
